<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes flat at 475/476/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes flat at 475/476/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat in moderate trade at 475.00/476.00 per dollar with little change for the rate seen over the coming week, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Most of today's dollar demand was by corporates, but nothing unusual for the time of year,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>Brokers added the Central Bank continued to be the single largest seller of dollars.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
